  "sourceTitle": "Szechuan Braised Chicken Wings",
  "sourceText": "Szechuan Braised Chicken Wings\nBy: BestOodles\nPublished: Sunday, April 3, 2011 - 9:43pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n24 chicken wings\n2 cups water\n2 tablespoons soy sauce\n2 tablespoons dark soy sauce\n2 tablespoons Szechuan peppercorns\n2 tablespoons red pepper crushed\n2 large sugar rocks\n3 star anises\n1 lemon juiced\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook all ingredients in boiling water; turn to simmer for 55 to an hour until all liquid are gone. 2 Add lemon juice and mix well.  Ready to serve, enjoy!",
  "parsedSource": {
